Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.93,0:20:45.27,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}otona ja nai
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.27,0:20:46.85,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}senaka ni tsukete
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.85,0:20:48.77,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}mata iiwake bakari
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.06,0:20:51.40,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}aseri toritsukuroeba
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.40,0:20:52.86,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}shiwa ni naru
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.27,0:20:55.65,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}otana ja nai
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.65,0:20:57.15,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}semai koko ni wa
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.15,0:20:59.24,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}kigen hakaru sube sae
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.45,0:21:04.91,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}oita mama heya no sumi wasureteru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.41,0:21:07.83,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}daihon nante nakute
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.83,0:21:10.42,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}tsumazuite bakari
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:15.75,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}totsuzen me no mae no zenbu shimawareteta
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.80,0:21:18.21,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}kuusou demo nakute
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.34,0:21:20.34,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}sora mimi ja nai
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.34,0:21:24.76,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}koe ga kizu wo sotto iyashiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.89,0:21:30.06,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}machigae mo osoroi da ne tte waraetari
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:35.73,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}kakidashita negai bukiyou dakedo shinjireba ii
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:41.49,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}massugu ni aruiteru tsumori demo kimatte
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.53,0:21:44.99,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}shiranai basho derun da
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.83,0:21:50.04,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}okubyou demo itsuka
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.93,0:20:45.27,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}Eu ainda sou apenas uma criança.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.27,0:20:46.85,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}É o que eu digo a mim mesma.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.85,0:20:48.77,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}Mas eu sei que não é exatamente por isso.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.06,0:20:51.40,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}Um dia, todas as desculpas que eu inventei
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.40,0:20:52.86,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}cairão sobre mim.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.27,0:20:55.65,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}Eu ainda sou apenas uma criança,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.65,0:20:57.15,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}sentada no meu pequeno quarto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.15,0:20:59.24,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}Enquanto peso meu pedaço de felicidade,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.45,0:21:04.91,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}o tempo passa, e logo esqueço o que o encheu de alegria.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.41,0:21:07.83,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}Não há um roteiro com falas para ler.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.83,0:21:10.42,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}Eu não sei como desempenhar meu papel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:15.75,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}De repente, tudo diante de mim desmoronou.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.80,0:21:18.21,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}Eu sei que não estou ouvindo coisas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.34,0:21:20.34,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}Não está só na minha cabeça.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.34,0:21:24.76,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}Há uma voz que pode curar suavemente minhas feridas.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.89,0:21:30.06,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}Nós rimos juntas dos nossos erros combinados.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.10,0:21:35.73,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}Mesmo que meus desejos escritos sejam desajeitados, é bom acreditar neles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.82,0:21:41.49,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}Eu prometi a mim mesma que continuaria, não importa o quão longe ou por quanto tempo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.53,0:21:44.99,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}Eu marcharei para o escuro e o desconhecido.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.83,0:21:50.04,ED pt-BR,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\blur2}É assustador, mas eu sei que um dia...!
